---
import Info from '../components/Info.astro'
---
<div class="bg-base-100 flex justify-between gap-4 m-10">
  <div class="flex flex-col ">
    <div class="my-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Why ModularJobs?</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs">
      ModularJobs is a Paper plugin for configurable jobs, task progression, payables, boosts, and
      upgrade trees.
    </p>
    <div class="feature-list my-2">
      <p class="text-md font-bold">Features:</p>
      <ul class="text-xs list-disc list-outside pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li>Define jobs, tasks, experience curves, and optional economy payables</li>
        <li>Persist progression and editor sessions with operator-managed PostgreSQL</li>
        <li>Use optional Mint, PlaceholderAPI, mcMMO, Bolt, LWC, and Choco integrations</li>
        <li>Configure timed, item-based, and context-aware boosts</li>
        <li>Apply upgrade trees and profession service APIs</li>
        <li>Enable the secure web editor only when an external REST API is configured</li>
        <li>Use the Craftux-backed Paper UI included by the current deferred dependency path</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="w-1/2">
    <Info/>
  </div>
</div>